  "schema:identifier": "id-6665684387505f2a8129f914b7e5717b",
  "schema:name": "SF Reporting in the DIIG Enterprise Architecture (DTH SFP Fig. 3)",
  "schema:description": "Substandard and falsified (SF) medical product reporting within the DIIG Digital Health Enterprise Architecture Framework (Section 3.2, Fig. 3, PDF 33-34): placing the SF Reporting Application in the Point-of-Service layer (specializing Point-of-service application), the NMRA Case Management Back End and Pharmacovigilance System in the Business Domain Services layer (linked into dth-sc Regulatory Systems and Quality Systems), and DPI-H registries (Product Registry, DPI-H Health Workforce Registry, Facility registry), Terminology Service, Identity Management Service, DPI-F Security & Consent Module, Update Subscription/Notification, and Interoperability Component in the foundational and interoperability layers.",
